# KosmicKrisp's VK_EXT_transform_feedback: Mesa merge request !44928, open when taken (2026-11-17,
# head e56f2e43), applied by Vendor/build-mesa.sh over the pinned Mesa commit. Zink builds GL's
# transform feedback on it, and without it the GL Zink offers stops short of 4.0. Drop this file
# once the request is merged and the pin moves past it.
From ba4df157e823ea31916db4e7c843e14f1fa9d033 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Willie Abrams <willie@pobox.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 14:05:23 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] kk: Keep GS metadata with the pipeline's VS

Use the GS info saved in the vertex shader rather than looking up the
bound geometry shader. That also lets draws find the info for a GS the
driver adds for transform feedback.

